#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Generate fixtures/mutations/: one-change variants of the spec examples (CONTRACT.md C-095..C-099).

    scripts/gen-mutations          (re)write every file in fixtures/mutations/
    scripts/gen-mutations --check  exit 1 if a file is missing, stale or not generated here (verify.sh)

Each fixture is the spec's incident-triage contract or the sealed valid/full.lock with exactly
one change, written as JSON (which is YAML). Lockfile variants are re-sealed, so they reach the
rule under test instead of stopping at the integrity check, unless the entry says `seal=False`.
The expected output of each file is pinned in fixtures/cases.json, where it was reviewed by hand
after all three ports agreed. This script only makes the inputs.
"""
